SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Patelo (Lakki)
LOCATION:Patelo\, Leros\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Agios Panteleimon feast on Leros is at Patelo\, above Lakki\, with a traditional glendi on the central square on the evening of the 26th: local orchestra\, free wine\, dancing. Organised with the municipality\, so it is well set up with tables.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/leros/#patelo-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-patelo-lakki
